{
    "title": "Mega Hit Poker: Texas Holdem",
    "description": "Play Texas Holdem Poker Online against millions of players all around the world and prove your mega poker skills!\r\n\r\nMega Hit Poker is designed to offer the BEST POKER EXPERIENCE POSSIBLE in a hand held device! Become a Champion in our Top Player Mode and prove that you are better than the rest! Are you up for the challenge? Play now and find out!\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\u25cf FREE CHIPS - Get LOADS of free chips just by logging in! Play poker and win big!\r\n\u25cf CROSSPLAY - Enjoy Mega Hit Poker on all devices! PCs, Tablets, and Mobiles and even Smart TVs!\r\n\u25cf MASSIVE ONLINE TOURNAMENTS - Compete with UP TO 1,000 PLAYERS in real time! Win and prove that you are the true poker master!\r\n\u25cf WEEKLY LEAGUE - Win the most chips during the league to be on top of the chart and win huge prizes! You are automatically participated just by playing Poker!\r\n\u25cf VARIOUS GAME MODES \u2013 Cash Games, Sit & Go, Shoot-out, and Tournaments. All kinds of Texas Holdem Poker! Don\u2019t forget about the special game modes we have as well!\r\n\u25cf VIP BENEFITS - Reach high Levels in our VIP memberships and earn various in-game benefits such as exclusive chip package offerings! You can get VIP points just by playing poker!\r\n\u25cf NO LIMIT HOLDEM - Play big, win big! Real Texas Holdem poker players are never afraid to go all-in.\r\n\u25cf PLAYER RECORDS - Check your play history to improve yourself or check others to find out their play patterns to beat them!\r\n\u25cf SOCIAL FEATURES \u2013 Connect your Facebook Account to the game to get a handsome reward! Being able to safely secure your account is a plus!\r\n\u25cf SLOT MACHINE \u2013 Bored at the poker table? Don\u2019t worry! Hit the SLOTS while you\u2019re waiting!\r\n\u25cf TOP OF THE SHARKS \u2013 Are you a Shark? Can you spot out the fish? Prove to the rest that you are better and mark your name in the Hall of Fame!\r\n\u25cf VARIOUS EVENT SALES PROMOTION \u2013 Interested in our chip offerings? We\u2019ve got you covered! Enjoy the various sales promotions we have going at ALL TIMES!\r\n\r\nRNG Certified\r\nThe card shuffling algorithm used in Mega Hit Poker has been tested and certified by iTech Labs! You can check the certification by going to the in-game settings menu! Mega Hit Poker supports fair game play!\r\n\r\nWe are happy to hear your voice! Come find us at Facebook Page(https://facebook.com/megahitpoker) or send us a ticket via the in-game CS feature!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s time to play Texas Holdem poker! Hit the tables and show them what you\u2019ve got!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play Texas Holdem Poker Online against millions of players all around the world and prove your mega poker skills!<br><br>Mega Hit Poker is designed to offer the BEST POKER EXPERIENCE POSSIBLE in a hand held device! Become a Champion in our Top Player Mode and prove that you are better than the rest! Are you up for the challenge? Play now and find out!<br><br>Features<br>\u25cf FREE CHIPS - Get LOADS of free chips just by logging in! Play poker and win big!<br>\u25cf CROSSPLAY - Enjoy Mega Hit Poker on all devices! PCs, Tablets, and Mobiles and even Smart TVs!<br>\u25cf MASSIVE ONLINE TOURNAMENTS - Compete with UP TO 1,000 PLAYERS in real time! Win and prove that you are the true poker master!<br>\u25cf WEEKLY LEAGUE - Win the most chips during the league to be on top of the chart and win huge prizes! You are automatically participated just by playing Poker!<br>\u25cf VARIOUS GAME MODES \u2013 Cash Games, Sit &amp; Go, Shoot-out, and Tournaments. All kinds of Texas Holdem Poker! Don\u2019t forget about the special game modes we have as well!<br>\u25cf VIP BENEFITS - Reach high Levels in our VIP memberships and earn various in-game benefits such as exclusive chip package offerings! You can get VIP points just by playing poker!<br>\u25cf NO LIMIT HOLDEM - Play big, win big! Real Texas Holdem poker players are never afraid to go all-in.<br>\u25cf PLAYER RECORDS - Check your play history to improve yourself or check others to find out their play patterns to beat them!<br>\u25cf SOCIAL FEATURES \u2013 Connect your Facebook Account to the game to get a handsome reward! Being able to safely secure your account is a plus!<br>\u25cf SLOT MACHINE \u2013 Bored at the poker table? Don\u2019t worry! Hit the SLOTS while you\u2019re waiting!<br>\u25cf TOP OF THE SHARKS \u2013 Are you a Shark? Can you spot out the fish? Prove to the rest that you are better and mark your name in the Hall of Fame!<br>\u25cf VARIOUS EVENT SALES PROMOTION \u2013 Interested in our chip offerings? We\u2019ve got you covered! Enjoy the various sales promotions we have going at ALL TIMES!<br><br>RNG Certified<br>The card shuffling algorithm used in Mega Hit Poker has been tested and certified by iTech Labs! You can check the certification by going to the in-game settings menu! Mega Hit Poker supports fair game play!<br><br>We are happy to hear your voice! Come find us at Facebook Page(https://facebook.com/megahitpoker) or send us a ticket via the in-game CS feature!<br><br>It\u2019s time to play Texas Holdem poker! Hit the tables and show them what you\u2019ve got!",
